  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Biblioteksstudie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Library Study - Consultants/Evaluations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den planerade studien ska belysa hur biblioteken i ett samh&#xe4;lle p&#xe5;verkar utvecklingen generellt och m&#xe4;nniskors f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga och potential att delta i samh&#xe4;llsutvecklingen. Studien ska genomf&#xf6;raas i Botswana, d&#xe4;r Sida l&#xe4;mnat st&#xf6;d till biblioteksv&#xe4;sendet sedan 1970-talet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned study shall through light on the role of libraries in a society and how they have influenced the development and the potential of people to participate in the development. The study shall be carried out in Botswana where Sida has supported the library system since the 1970ies.</narrative>
  </description>
